[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 4(75 + 117i)(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{1}{4}(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Expanding the terms, we have:
