[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Combining like terms, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
