[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). So, the maximum value of \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
