[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Substituting \(z = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 117i\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = (24 - 36i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta - i(24\sin\theta - 36\cos\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Combining these, the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta - i(24\sin\theta - 36\cos\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Separating the real and imaginary parts, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \text{Real part} = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m To maximize the real part, we need to maximize \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). This can be done by expressing it in the form \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\), where \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\) and \(\tan\phi = \frac{432}{324} = \frac{4}{3}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m So, \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540\).
