[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m Substituting \(z = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta + 117i\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} (\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) + 36i(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24\cos\theta - 24i\sin\theta + 36i\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
