[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3001510)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324\cos\theta - 504\sin\theta\). To find the maximum value of this expression, we can use the method of finding the amplitude of the trigonometric function. The maximum value of \(a\cos\theta - b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = 504\), so the maximum value is:
